1
00:00:00,439 --> 00:00:01,649
(Leonard:)Your cousin Leopold.

2
00:00:01,815 --> 00:00:04,355
Whom most people call Leo,
but he also answers to Lee.

3
00:00:04,526 --> 00:00:05,946
(Sheldon:)Remember that, it's important.

4
00:00:06,403 --> 00:00:08,493
- What's important?
- Details, Leonard.

5
00:00:08,655 --> 00:00:12,825
(Sheldon:)The success or failure
of our deceitful enterprise turns on details.

6
00:00:12,993 --> 00:00:16,533
- Do you have a cousin Leopold?
- No, I made him up.

7
00:00:17,247 --> 00:00:19,707
(Sheldon:)I think you'd call him Lee.

8
00:00:20,751 --> 00:00:24,541
(Leonard:)I don't get it. I already told her a lie,
why replace it with a different lie?

9
00:00:24,713 --> 00:00:27,503
(Sheldon:)Well, first of all,
your lie was laughably transparent...

10
00:00:27,674 --> 00:00:30,094
(Sheldon:)...where mine is exquisitely convoluted.

11
00:00:31,303 --> 00:00:35,803
(Sheldon:)While you were sleeping,
I was weaving an un-unravelable web.

12
00:00:35,974 --> 00:00:38,394
- Un-unravelable?
- Yes.

13
00:00:38,560 --> 00:00:41,480
(Sheldon:)If she Googles Leopold Houston,
she'll find a Facebook page...

14
00:00:41,647 --> 00:00:44,237
(Sheldon:)...an online blog
depicting his descent into drug use...

15
00:00:44,399 --> 00:00:48,109
(Sheldon:)...and a desperate
yet hopeful listing on eHarmony.com.

16
00:00:48,946 --> 00:00:52,786
(Leonard:)Okay, why would I go
to a drug intervention for your cousin?

17
00:00:52,950 --> 00:00:57,020
Ah! Because it's in Long Beach
and I don't drive.

